/* One Germany, Three Seas -- JavaScript edition of the finished map.
 * Offline: no npm, APIs, downloads or network requests.
 * Browser: open the companion germany_three_seas.html beside this file.
 * Node.js: node germany_three_seas.js
 * Node writes SVG, PNG, licence and a browser viewer beside this file.
 * Embedded graphics preserve the original river geometry and national boundary.
 * This renders the prepared map; it does not repeat the GIS preprocessing.
 * Sources: HydroRIVERS / WWF & McGill; Lehner & Grill (2013),
 * https://doi.org/10.1002/hyp.9740 ; Natural Earth boundaries.
 * HydroRIVERS-derived content remains governed by DATA_LICENCE below.
 */
